      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DRINK TINS (2) is a talented dog who is a winner of 24 races and filled a minor placing latest when second at this track (25.37). Form here at the trip excellent including three wins. Goes very well from this draw with four wins and three minor placings from 10 starts. Likely to feature again. SHOUT OUT SHAZAM (3) looks close to another win after finishing third from Box 8 last time (30.61) at this track. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Expected to feature again. HOOKED ON DOLLY (1) had been racing in honest fashion recording two placings in a row before finishing fourth (35.32) at Q Parklands latest. Form here sound including two wins. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from four starts. Deserves plenty of respect. SPRING FOCUS (6) is in the mix despite missing out at this track last time.",
